---
import { url } from '../../lib/url';

const base = `intranet/sib/`;
const updated = '2026.05.24 14:22';
---

<div class="flex flex-wrap justify-between items-end gap-3 mb-[18px]">
  <h1 class="sib-page-title">차출요원 통합 현황</h1>
  <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3.5 items-center sib-page-meta">
    <span>최근 갱신 {updated}</span>
    <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[#22a06b] font-semibold">
      <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-[#22a06b] rounded-full"></span>
      접속 중
    </span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="sib-alert">
  <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3.5">
    <span class="text-[11px] text-imc-danger font-bold bg-white border border-[#f5d8d0] px-[9px] py-[3px] rounded-[2px]">긴급 · D-3</span>
    <span class="text-[13px] font-medium text-[#1a1a1a]">신천 사건 15주기 추모일 (05.27) — 차출요원 전원 비상 대기, 출입 제한 강화 조치</span>
  </div>
  <a href={url('notices/')} class="text-[11.5px] text-imc-danger font-bold no-underline hover:underline">자세히 →</a>
</div>

<div class="sib-stat-grid">
  <div class="sib-stat-card">
    <p class="sib-stat-label">위험도 등급</p>
    <div class="flex items-baseline gap-2 mb-[18px]">
      <p class="sib-stat-value m-0">二級</p>
      <span class="sib-stat-desc">통제 대상</span>
    </div>
    <div class="sib-stat-meta">
      <div class="sib-stat-meta-row"><span>감시 수준</span><span>상시 추적</span></div>
      <div class="sib-stat-meta-row"><span>이동 제한</span><span>관외 허가제</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="sib-stat-card">
    <p class="sib-stat-label">작전 등급</p>
    <div class="flex items-baseline gap-2 mb-[18px]">
      <p class="sib-stat-value m-0">乙</p>
      <span class="sib-stat-desc">중위험·일반 작전</span>
    </div>
    <div class="sib-stat-meta">
      <div class="sib-stat-meta-row"><span>방출량</span><span>중(中)</span></div>
      <div class="sib-stat-meta-row"><span>매칭 우선순위</span><span>일반</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="sib-stat-card">
    <p class="sib-stat-label">봉인 상태</p>
    <div class="flex items-baseline gap-2 mb-[18px]">
      <p class="sib-stat-value m-0">未實施</p>
      <span class="sib-stat-desc">차단제 처방 중</span>
    </div>
    <div class="sib-stat-meta">
      <div class="sib-stat-meta-row"><span>처방 약물</span><span>차단제 정기</span></div>
      <div class="sib-stat-meta-row"><span>최종 갱신</span><span>2026.05.18</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="sib-stat-card">
    <p class="sib-stat-label">매칭·동기화</p>
    <div class="flex items-baseline gap-2 mb-[18px]">
      <p class="sib-stat-value m-0">未매칭</p>
      <span class="text-xs text-imc-danger font-bold" style="letter-spacing:-0.01em;">매칭 대기 중</span>
    </div>
    <div class="sib-match-steps">
      <div class="sib-match-step">
        <div class="sib-match-dot bg-imc-danger text-white">
          <svg width="9" height="9" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12l5 5L20 7" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <span class="text-[8.5px] font-semibold text-[#525252]">접수</span>
      </div>
      <div class="sib-match-line bg-imc-danger"></div>
      <div class="sib-match-step">
        <div class="sib-match-dot bg-imc-danger text-white border border-imc-danger">2</div>
        <span class="text-[8.5px] font-bold text-imc-danger">탐색</span>
      </div>
      <div class="sib-match-line bg-[#e5e7eb]"></div>
      <div class="sib-match-step">
        <div class="sib-match-dot bg-[#f5f6f8] text-[#888] border border-[#e5e7eb]">3</div>
        <span class="text-[8.5px] font-semibold text-[#888]">평가</span>
      </div>
      <div class="sib-match-line bg-[#e5e7eb]"></div>
      <div class="sib-match-step">
        <div class="sib-match-dot bg-[#f5f6f8] text-[#888] border border-[#e5e7eb]">4</div>
        <span class="text-[8.5px] font-semibold text-[#888]">확정</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="grid lg:grid-cols-[1.6fr_1fr] gap-3.5 mb-[18px]">
  <div class="sib-panel">
    <div class="sib-panel-head">
      <span class="sib-panel-head-title">작전 명령서</span>
      <div class="flex gap-3.5 items-center text-[11.5px]">
        <span class="text-imc-danger font-bold">미열람 2건</span>
        <a href={url(`${base}documents/`)} class="text-[#525252] font-semibold no-underline hover:underline">전체보기 +</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <a href={url(`${base}documents/`)} class="sib-op-row priority">
      <div class="sib-op-bar bg-imc-danger"></div>
      <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
        <div class="sib-op-tags">
          <span class="sib-tag red">최우선</span>
          <span class="sib-tag outline sib-op-code">OP-2026-0XXX</span>
          <span class="text-[11px] text-[#666]">갑급 작전 지원</span>
        </div>
        <p class="sib-op-title">[극비] 수도권 □□구역 미등재자 거점 진압 작전 — 차출 명령</p>
        <p class="sib-op-meta">집결 · 05.25 04:00 / 본청 B3 · 발령 작전과장 □□□</p>
      </div>
      <span class="text-[#525252] shrink-0 text-sm">→</span>
    </a>
    <a href={url(`${base}documents/`)} class="sib-op-row urgent">
      <div class="sib-op-bar bg-[#e8b870]"></div>
      <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
        <div class="sib-op-tags">
          <span class="sib-tag amber">긴급</span>
          <span class="sib-tag outline sib-op-code">OP-2026-0XXX</span>
          <span class="text-[11px] text-[#666]">을급 작전</span>
        </div>
        <p class="sib-op-title">[대외비] △△지역 신흥종교 잔당 추적 — 합동 작전</p>
        <p class="sib-op-meta">집결 · 05.28 09:00 / 지역분실 □ · 발령 □□處</p>
      </div>
      <span class="text-[#525252] shrink-0 text-sm">→</span>
    </a>
    <a href={url(`${base}documents/`)} class="sib-op-row">
      <div class="sib-op-bar bg-[#e0e2e7]"></div>
      <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
        <div class="sib-op-tags">
          <span class="sib-tag gray">완료</span>
          <span class="sib-tag outline sib-op-code text-[#888]">OP-2026-0XXX</span>
          <span class="text-[11px] text-[#888]">병급 작전</span>
        </div>
        <p class="sib-op-title font-semibold text-[#525252]">[대외비] 보호처분소 외곽 경계 임시 차출</p>
        <p class="sib-op-meta text-[#888]">완료 · 05.20 · 보고서 제출 완료</p>
      </div>
      <span class="text-[#aaa] shrink-0 text-sm">→</span>
    </a>
    <a href={url(`${base}documents/`)} class="sib-op-row border-b-0">
      <div class="sib-op-bar bg-[#e0e2e7]"></div>
      <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
        <div class="sib-op-tags">
          <span class="sib-tag gray">완료</span>
          <span class="sib-tag outline sib-op-code text-[#888]">OP-2026-0XXX</span>
          <span class="text-[11px] text-[#888]">을급 작전</span>
        </div>
        <p class="sib-op-title font-semibold text-[#525252]">[대외비] 미등재자 색출 합동작전 — 후속 진술 의무</p>
        <p class="sib-op-meta text-[#888]">완료 · 05.14 · 보고서 검토 중</p>
      </div>
      <span class="text-[#aaa] shrink-0 text-sm">→</span>
    </a>
  </div>

  <div class="sib-panel">
    <div class="sib-panel-head">
      <span class="sib-panel-head-title">의무 보고·일정</span>
      <a href={url(`${base}documents/`)} class="text-[11.5px] text-[#525252] font-semibold no-underline hover:underline">+ 새 보고</a>
    </div>
    <a href={url(`${base}documents/`)} class="sib-report-row bg-[#fffbf3] hover:bg-[#fff8eb]">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1.5">
        <span class="sib-tag amber">기한 임박</span>
        <span class="text-[11px] text-[#92400e] font-bold">D-1</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-[13px] font-bold text-[#1a1a1a] mb-1 leading-[1.4]">월간 정기 진술서 (5월분)</p>
      <p class="sib-op-meta">기한 05.25 23:59 · 양식 <span class="sib-op-code">M-FORM-03</span></p>
    </a>
    <a href={url(`${base}documents/`)} class="sib-report-row hover:bg-[#fafafa]">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1.5">
        <span class="sib-tag gray">정기</span>
        <span class="text-[11px] font-semibold text-[#525252]">D-7</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-[13px] font-semibold text-[#525252] mb-1 leading-[1.4]">분기 정기 검진 (2분기)</p>
      <p class="sib-op-meta text-[#888]">조정원 본원 · 예약 필요</p>
    </a>
    <a href={url(`${base}documents/`)} class="sib-report-row hover:bg-[#fafafa]">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1.5">
        <span class="sib-tag gray">정기</span>
        <span class="text-[11px] font-semibold text-[#525252]">D-12</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-[13px] font-semibold text-[#525252] mb-1 leading-[1.4]">차단제 처방 갱신</p>
      <p class="sib-op-meta text-[#888]">조정원 의료센터 · 자동 갱신 가능</p>
    </a>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="sib-panel" id="notices">
  <div class="sib-panel-head">
    <span class="sib-panel-head-title">내부 공지</span>
    <a href={url(`${base}documents/`)} class="text-[11.5px] text-[#525252] font-semibold no-underline hover:underline">전체보기 +</a>
  </div>
  <a href={url(`${base}documents/`)} class="sib-notice-row">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 flex-1 min-w-0">
      <span class="sib-tag red shrink-0">긴급</span>
      <span class="text-[12.5px] font-semibold text-[#1a1a1a] truncate">전 차출요원 비상 대기 명령 (05.25 00:00 — 05.28 24:00)</span>
    </div>
    <span class="text-[11px] text-[#888] shrink-0 font-semibold">2026.05.23</span>
  </a>
  <a href={url(`${base}documents/`)} class="sib-notice-row">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 flex-1 min-w-0">
      <span class="sib-tag gray shrink-0">공지</span>
      <span class="text-[12.5px] text-[#525252] font-medium truncate">차출요원 숙소 출입 게이트 보안 시스템 업데이트 안내</span>
    </div>
    <span class="text-[11px] text-[#888] shrink-0 font-semibold">2026.05.22</span>
  </a>
  <a href={url(`${base}documents/`)} class="sib-notice-row">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 flex-1 min-w-0">
      <span class="sib-tag gray shrink-0">공지</span>
      <span class="text-[12.5px] text-[#525252] font-medium truncate">2026년도 동기화 매칭 우선순위 산정 기준 개정 안내</span>
    </div>
    <span class="text-[11px] text-[#888] shrink-0 font-semibold">2026.05.18</span>
  </a>
  <a href={url(`${base}documents/`)} class="sib-notice-row">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 flex-1 min-w-0">
      <span class="sib-tag gray shrink-0">행정</span>
      <span class="text-[12.5px] text-[#525252] font-medium truncate">분기 정기 진료 일정 배정 안내 (2분기)</span>
    </div>
    <span class="text-[11px] text-[#888] shrink-0 font-semibold">2026.05.15</span>
  </a>
</div>
